OL,3,GNEWSAMajor delays on M61 after
OL,4,Amulti-vehicle crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FDrivers are facing delays on part of
OL,7,Fthe M61 after a crash involving
OL,8,Fmultiple vehicles.
OL,10,FIt happened at 06.09 BST and led to one
OL,11,Flane on the southbound side of the
OL,12,Fmotorway being blocked, National
OL,13,FHighways said.
OL,15,FTraffic is still heavy between junction
OL,16,Feight at Chorley, Lancashire, and
OL,17,Fjunction six for Horwich, Bolton,
OL,18,FGreater Manchester.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
