OL,3,GNEWSAMajor delays on M61 after
OL,4,Amulti-vehicle crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FNational Highways said there was around
OL,7,Fthree miles of congestion between
OL,8,FLimbrick and Grimeford Village, which
OL,9,Fis adding roughly 30 minutes onto
OL,10,Fjourney times.
